    kg:textSpan "by Microsoft. P.P. and D.R. were supported by ONR MURI Grant N00014-10-1-0933. We would like to thank all members of the community who provided valuable feedback throughout the process of dening and collecting the dataset. A PPENDIX I: U SER I NTERFACES We describe and visualize our user interfaces for collecting non-iconic images, category labeling, instance spotting, instance segmentation, segmentation verication and nally crowd labeling. Non-iconic Image Collection Flickr provides a rich imag" .

