    kg:textSpan "more efcient method for annotation. Rather than requiring workers to draw exact polygonal masks around each object instance, we allow workers to paint all pixels belonging to the category in question. Crowd labeling is similar to semantic segmentation as object instance are not individually identied. We emphasize that crowd labeling is only necessary for images containing more than ten object instances of a given category. Fig. 10: User interfaces for non-iconic image collection. (a) Interface f" .

