    kg:textSpan "layers and two fully connected layers with randomly initialized weights. Detection often requires ne-grained visual information so we increase the input resolution of the network from 224 224 to 448 448 . Our nal layer predicts both class probabilities and bounding box coordinates. We normalize the bounding box width and height by the image width and height so that they fall between 0 and 1. We parametrize the bounding box x and y coordinates to be offsets of a particular grid cell location so t" .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/1506_02640_rag__chunk_006> a kg:Chunk ;
