    kg:textSpan "attention model, and for data augmentation when training our VQA model. The dataset contains 108K images densely annotated with scene graphs containing objects, attributes and relationships, as well as 1.7M visual question answers. For pretraining the bottom-up attention model, we use only the object and attribute data. We reserve 5K images for validation, and 5K images for future testing, treating the remaining 98K images as training data. As approximately 51K Visual Genome images are also foun" .

