    kg:textSpan "caption quality, we use the standard automatic evaluation metrics, namely SPICE [ 1 ], CIDEr [ 43 ], METEOR [ 8 ], ROUGE-L [ 22 ] and BLEU [ 29 ]. As the object and attribute annotations consist of freely annotated strings, rather than classes, we perform extensive cleaning and ltering of the training data. Starting from 2,000 object classes and 500 attribute classes, we manually remove abstract classes that exhibit poor detection performance in initial experiments. Our nal training set contains" .

