    kg:textSpan "standard CNN is built with fully connected layers and a number of blocks consisting of convolutions, activation function layer and max pooling [3, 4, 5]. The complex nature of CNNs requires a signicant computational power for training and evaluation of the networks, which is addressed with the help of modern graphical processing units (GPUs). A common problem in real life applications of deep learning based classiers is that some classes have a signicantly higher number of examples in the traini" .

