    kg:textSpan "existence of the instantiated entity in the image. An obvious way to represent existence is by using a separate logistic unit whose output is the probability that the entity exists. In this paper we explore an interesting alternative which is to use the overall length of the vector of instantiation parameters to represent the existence of the entity and to force the orientation 31st Conference on Neural Information Processing Systems (NIPS 2017), Long Beach, CA, USA. of the vector to represent t" .

