    kg:textSpan "translation and any natural transformation seen in the standard MNIST. An under-trained CapsNet with early stopping which achieved 99.23% accuracy on the expanded MNIST test set achieved 79% accuracy on the affnist test set. A traditional convolutional model with a similar number of parameters which achieved similar accuracy (99.22%) on the expanded mnist test set only achieved 66% on the affnist test set. 6 Segmenting highly overlapping digits Dynamic routing can be viewed as a parallel attenti" .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/1802_01528_rag__chunk_002> a kg:Chunk ;
