    kg:textSpan ". 31 9 Notation 31 10 Resources 32 2 1 Introduction Most of us last saw calculus in school, but derivatives are a critical part of machine learning, particularly deep neural networks, which are trained by optimizing a loss function. Pick up a machine learning paper or the documentation of a library such as PyTorch and calculus comes screeching back into your life like distant relatives around the holidays. And its not just any old scalar calculus that pops upyou need dierential matrix calculus ," .

