    kg:textSpan "with 2600 unique image-label pairs, acquired from [16] using a python script that we wrote. Labels are short descriptions referring to the image, i.e. the meme template, and are the same for identical images. Accordingly, each image-label pair is associated with several (roughly 160) different captions. A sample from our dataset is shown in table 1. Before training our model with the captions, we performed a preprocessing on our dataset. Each word in the caption was lowercased to match the GloVe" .

