    kg:textSpan "an entire new model for every new task. A high degree of sharing between The two most common transfer learning techniques in NLP are feature-based transfer and ne-tuning. Instead, we present an alternative transfer method based on adapter modules ( Rebufet al. , 2017 ). Features-based transfer involves pre-training real-valued embeddings vectors. These embeddings may be at the word ( Mikolov et al. , 2013 ), sentence ( Cer et al. , 2019 ), or paragraph level ( Le & Mikolov , 2014 ). The embeddin" .

