    kg:docId "JMLRdropout_rag" ;
    kg:inPaper <http://example.org/kg/paper/JMLRdropout_rag> ;
    kg:textSpan "The validation set was then combined with the training set and training was done for 1 million weight updates. This net was used to evaluate the performance on the test set. This way of using the validation set was chosen because we found that it was easy to set up hyperparameters so that early stopping was not required at all. Therefore, once the hyperparameters were xed, it made sense to combine the validation and training sets and train for a very long time. 1953 Srivastava, Hinton, Krizhevsk" .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/JMLRdropout_rag__chunk_023> a kg:Chunk ;
