    kg:textSpan ", 0 . 8 } 3. dropout in { 0 . 0 , 0 . 1 , 0 . 3 , 0 . 5 } We present the three best architectures that our search has discovered. While these architectures are similar to the GRU, they outperform it on the tasks we considered. MUT1: z = sigm( W xz x t + b z ) Arch. N N-dropout P Tanh 3.612 3.267 6.809 LSTM 3.492 3.403 6.866 LSTM-f 3.732 3.420 6.813 LSTM-i 3.426 3.252 6.856 LSTM-o 3.406 3.253 6.870 LSTM-b 3.419 3.345 6.820 GRU 3.410 3.427 6.876 MUT1 3.254 3.376 6.792 MUT2 3.372 3.429 6.852 MUT3 3" .

