    kg:textSpan "classication models (trained on the same scales), and the initial learning rate was set to 10 3 . We explored both ne-tuning all layers and ne-tuning only the rst two fully-connected layers, as done in (Sermanet et al., 2014). The last fully-connected layer was initialised randomly and trained from scratch. Testing. We consider two testing protocols. The rst is used for comparing different network modications on the validation set, and considers only the bounding box prediction for the ground tr" .

