    kg:textSpan "model components, but model selection contains some important techniques that HPO doesnt involve in, hence it is necessary to take model selection apart from HPO for discussion. The contributions of this paper are as follows: 1) Although there are several surveys related to AutoML (e.g. [3], [4], [31]), we cover a wider range of existing AutoML techniques according to the pipeline (Fig. 2) of machine learning, which gives the beginners a comprehensive and clear understanding of AutoML. Specicall" .

