    kg:textSpan "image, and if these labels have very close condence score or the label with the highest score is the same with the original label of the image, they select this image as a new training sample. On the other hand, the distribution of web data can be extremely different from the target dataset, which would increase the difculty of training the model. A common solution is to ne-tune these web data [66], [67]. Yang et al. [52] an iterative algorithm for model training and web data ltering. Additional" .

