    kg:textSpan "Deep Residual Learning for Image Recognition Kaiming He Xiangyu Zhang Shaoqing Ren Jian Sun Microsoft Research { kahe, v-xiangz, v-shren, jiansun } @microsoft.com 20 20 Abstract training error (%) 56-layer test error (%) Deeper neural networks are more difcult to train. We present a residual learning framework to ease the training of networks that are substantially deeper than those used previously. We explicitly reformulate the layers as learning residual functions with reference to the layer i" .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/He_Deep_Residual_Learning_CVPR_2016_paper_rag__chunk_002> a kg:Chunk ;
    kg:chunkId "He_Deep_Residual_Learning_CVPR_2016_paper_rag::chunk_002" ;
