    kg:textSpan "wide gap relative to the feature-based baseline, the variation among different CNN architectures turns out to be surprisingly insignicant. Notably, the single-frame model already displays strong performance. Furthermore, we observe that the foveated architectures are between 2 4 faster in practice due to reduced input dimensionality. The precise speedups are in part a function of the details of model partitioning and our implementation, but in our experiments we observe a speedup during training" .

