    kg:textSpan "larger than a learned threshold. Domain-specic ne-tuning. To adapt our CNN to the new task (detection) and the new domain (warped proposal windows), we continue stochastic gradient descent (SGD) training of the CNN parameters using only warped region proposals. Aside from replacing the CNNs ImageNetspecic 1000-way classication layer with a randomly initialized ( N + 1 )-way classication layer (where N is the number of object classes, plus 1 for background), the CNN architecture is unchanged. For" .

