    kg:textSpan "by using Theorem 4.1 and P d i =1 g 1: T,i 2 dG T . Thus, lim T R ( T ) T = 0 . 5 R ELATED WORK Optimization methods bearing a direct relation to Adam are RMSProp (Tieleman & Hinton, 2012; Graves, 2013) and AdaGrad (Duchi et al., 2011); these relationships are discussed below. Other stochastic optimization methods include vSGD (Schaul et al., 2012), AdaDelta (Zeiler, 2012) and the natural Newton method from Roux & Fitzgibbon (2010), all setting stepsizes by estimating curvature 4 from rst-order " .

